+### 2. Detailed Visual Evidence Audit (`read_file` Forensic Review)
+All 15 screenshots in `docs/qa/KANBA-32/screenshots/` were forensically evaluated across Desktop (1440x900), Tablet (1024x768), and Mobile (390x844):
